{"430001":["Monarch is a soft semi-sheer peachy polish warmed with a kiss of orange/gold/lime shifting shimmer. All swatches are shown in 2-3 coats of polish and topped with FFL's True Tranquility QDTC or Mindfulness Matte-rs Top Coat. Swatches: @polishandpups, @nub.luv, @nails.and.hamer, @j_adorelife, @that.lacquer.girl, @sheislisab, & @ronitadasgupta77 Hand-poured in our full-size 15mL square-shaped bottle and includes 2 stainless steel mixing beads.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-4218_f3068aac-8e76-4cfb-a381-39513614a6cc.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/side-by_side__monarch.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/bottle-macro__monarch.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/Monarch-6.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/MONARCH-5_3f05b0bc-9e37-4655-8071-76f6ba070a29.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/20260419-143733.jpg?v=1776922580","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/DSC-3100.jpg?v=1778181778","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-8499_HEIC.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-20260430_184613__1000_x_1000_pixel.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/THUMB-COLLAGE_3.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-4249.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/Monarch-4.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/MONARCH-2.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/20260419-143758.jpg?v=1776922581","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/DSC-3102.jpg?v=1778181778","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-8495_HEIC.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-20260430_184513__1000_x_1000_pixel.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/IMG-4241.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/Monarch-3_78fa4652-d341-4827-bee0-4d77ad2abaea.jpg?v=1777853813","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0514/9759/9125/files/MONARCH-1_e75e2cda-d934-4668-9982-1c4fb7f62d3d.jpg?v=1777853813"]],"430002":["Glossy, quick-dry top coat for a smooth, long-lasting finish. Seals in color with a high-shine, glassy finish while helping to smooth the surface and extend wear. Quick-drying and self-leveling for an even, durable finish that enhances depth and protects against chips.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/FullSizeRender.jpg?v=1781298591"]],"430003":["A soft raspberry pink jelly packed with pink holographic glitter, a scattering of silver reflective and pink hex glitters, and a subtle pink-violet shimmer. Builds to full coverage in 2-3 coats. It can be used as a topper, but due to the density of glitter, is best applied in one very light coat when the polish underneath is fully dry. (Hint: try it over The Fixer!) Got Milkweed? is inspired by the mighty milkweed. Best known as the sole host plant for Monarch butterflies, there are more than 70 varieties native to North America, ranging in color from the delicate creams and pinks to vibrant fuchsias, and they support more than 450 species of insect. Its rich nectar is a magnet for pollinators, which in turn provide a valuable food source for birds as well. $1 of every polish sold will be donated to The Nature Conservancy",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/20260711_210320.jpg?v=1786327366","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Natalie_Collage-Got_Milkweed.jpg?v=1786333547","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8977.heic?v=1786329420","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8079.jpg?v=1786326529","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8966.heic?v=1786328957","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Lana-Collage_8f55a90d-3718-4bd1-8f7a-52aaf359e350.jpg?v=1786327757","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Cassandra-Collagge.jpg?v=1786326480","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Brandi-Collage.jpg?v=1786326465","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Kayla-Collage.jpg?v=1786327366","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_20260803_142908__1000_x_1000_pixel.jpg?v=1786337093","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_7938.jpg?v=1786327023","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Paola-Got_Milkweed.jpg?v=1786336852","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8699.jpg?v=1786328246","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8054.jpg?v=1786326480","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Leana-Collage_c7becb24-04db-4367-a542-efba481d2570.jpg?v=1786328245","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Milkweedthumbbottle1_1.jpg?v=1786326465","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/GM1.png?v=1786327759","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8716.jpg?v=1786328246","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Maya.jpg?v=1786328957","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_20260803_142522__1000_x_1000_pixel.jpg?v=1786337093"]],"430004":["Blackened purple jelly base with blue-to-cyan-purple shifting shimmer. Grudge is a deep, moody purple filled with a glowing aurora shimmer that shifts between blue, cyan, and purple in different lighting. Inspired by the enigmatic American crow and their remarkable memory for those who've wronged them, Grudge is a striking reminder that some things may be forgiven, but they're never forgotten. Full coverage in 2 coats for most nail lengths. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish and @ihavethisthingwithpolish shown in two coats over Understory Priming Base Coat.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8566.jpg?v=1786647313","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--19.jpg?v=1786645702","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8581.jpg?v=1786645582","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2069.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6524.jpg?v=1780772845","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8568.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-04_669a3f7a-12f6-4d1f-9632-2a3c0ddae3d9.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--3_afc7b2cd-4023-45ab-8679-a9e707cd470c.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--15_1e0e0257-8d73-4e64-8f79-25d198b19b33.jpg?v=1781241439","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_ed24b8fc-a67b-4afd-9dee-c777868baaca.jpg?v=1780772884","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6512.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--4_acb47354-59ca-4206-ad90-7a56dca6a513.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-221659.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--17_7160e98b-8e5f-4f23-8826-df6f12afb4da.jpg?v=1781241439","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_27d0a14d-8b30-48ae-9876-13aa1b133869.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2051.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-20260531110204.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9582.jpg?v=1781239194","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2083.jpg?v=1780772883","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--16_a6e2cb05-7c0b-4905-86eb-c3569e5abdbc.jpg?v=1781241439"]],"430005":[null,[]],"430006":["It's a Trap! is a deep navy jelly base with glowing violet shimmer that shifts to red. This polish is inspired by Tacca chantrieri, commonly known as the black bat flower, for its unique appearance resembling a bat in flight. The bat flower emits a foul odor that attracts pollinators, then traps them in its maze-like structures, leaving it to rely on self-pollination to reproduce.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Cover-Its_A_Trap.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_5.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_1.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_3.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_6.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_7jpg.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_4.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/UntitledProject.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-10_265a5102-1007-4534-b9a7-97fd29a2372f.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-214307.jpg?v=1785384224","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/It_s_A_Trap_2.jpg?v=1785384225"]],"430007":["Sheer jelly base with silver and blue reflective glitters, silver holo glitter, and a blue-to-indigo aurora shimmer. Inspired by the Karner Blue butterfly and its iridescent wings that shift from soft grays and blues to purple hues. Designed for versatility, Metamorphosis can be worn on its own as a sheer wash of light-shifting shimmer or used as a topper over other colors. Because of the sheerness, a blurring base coat is recommended to minimize visible nail line when worn on its own. Due to the glitter, it will dry down slightly textured, so be sure to use a top coat to restore a smooth and shiny finish. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish, @ihavethisthingwithpolish, and opposum_claw shown over Understory Priming Base Coat. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish shown in three coats over Understory Priming Base Coat. $1 of each polish sold will be donated to the non-profit Xerces Society for Invertebrate Conservation. The Karner Blue butterfly is listed as an endangered species, and was the inspiration for creating the Flighty by Nature charity collection. Habitat loss, pesticides, and climate change are affecting invertebrates at alarming rates, with populations declining globally by nearly 10% every decade.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9005.jpg?v=1780755115","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-443.jpg?v=1781915814","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-230531.jpg?v=1780757944","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2450.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--4_8b93b42f-00c4-4820-8617-88badb65fe71.jpg?v=1781278026","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9002_4464a582-8e86-4460-ae1d-da16f6ad4f2d.jpg?v=1780754987","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_b3442188-e74d-420a-95a6-5dcf6c9b8791.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-949.jpg?v=1781915814","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--3_3c9f6f78-8677-4a42-b0f8-1e10282b1f46.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--5_3aed1e31-336a-4765-aade-ce0ff4768cc4.jpg?v=1781278027","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_91f37bbb-cb45-45d1-a4e2-3681de04ee2a.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-01_d771415c-3e50-4a8c-b9b7-633a50230146.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8999.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9018.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--8_78dd3e50-17ec-4c24-947a-233545249278.jpg?v=1781278026","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-05_58c3557b-67b7-44f7-b842-f239c0d6bfd2.jpg?v=1781278037","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-230602.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-230713.jpg?v=1780757943","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--9_fdaa9ee6-7959-4f83-bc3f-d4a5c4af730c.jpg?v=1781278026","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-7_30b33479-4fb1-43e7-b0ee-de344b7166eb.jpg?v=1780757943"]],"430008":["Hot pink jelly base with pink-to-orange-to-violet shimmer. Inspired by the iridescent hues of the roseate skimmer dragonfly, this bold, color-shifting pink is guaranteed to make a splash at the pond.The name comes from a study where female dragonflies were caught in the act of faking their own deaths just to dodge the advances of overly persistent suitors. While playing dead to trick a predator is a classic animal move, playing dead to avoid an awkward date is next-level drama, seen in only a handful of species. Buildable in 1–2 coats. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish and @ihavethisthingwithpolish shown in two coats over Understory Priming Base Coat. $1 of each polish sold will be donated to the non-profit Xerces Society for Invertebrate Conservation.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_93cf9afb-62c8-4366-b9c1-f5073b7ee4b7.jpg?v=1780754005","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/file