0754006","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6569.jpg?v=1780754006"]],"430009":["Bright true red with red-to-orange-to-gold shifting shimmer. One in a Vermillion captures the striking coloring and aerial acrobatics of the vermilion flycatcher in a high-energy red with almost as much attitude as the bird that inspired it. Buildable in 2–3 coats. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish and @ihavethisthingwithpolish shown in two coats over Understory Priming Base Coat.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2187.jpg?v=1786649004","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-221306.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6538.jpg?v=1786646637","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9970.jpg?v=1780973592","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-02_218b7aeb-057d-4aa0-b8d7-44a56bd1d5ce.jpg?v=1780777037","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_9ef758a1-d491-447c-990f-7cda49a82e65.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--7_2fd5937e-abfb-419f-ad3a-e60f76e5847e.jpg?v=1780974418","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6506.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2098.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-06_adb0cd8a-bead-4819-861c-d44ae546f387.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2127.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6505.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-201034.jpg?v=1780973592","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--4_6ab85bea-d92a-40ba-a897-e9dcdbe56616.jpg?v=1780777063","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/fil