8444.jpg?v=1780727807","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-04.jpg?v=1780727808","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--5_4762f6a1-a6fa-4315-8558-5b48bc82bb4d.jpg?v=1781927025","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_f1db74c2-81d3-47e8-a538-3cc4d540b34c.jpg?v=1780727830","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_524495b7-610e-40a1-bbb1-c7a4694cdad0.jpg?v=1781055574","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-1730.jpg?v=1780727807","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-1648.jpg?v=1780727830","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6303.jpg?v=1780728983","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9511.jpg?v=1780727807","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8451.jpg?v=1780727808","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--6_e53fa3af-52e3-4917-9ec9-f52b6aa126ce.jpg?v=1781927024","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8407.jpg?v=1780727830"]],"430011":["Teal blue jelly with teal and silver holo glitter, and a soft blue-purple shimmer. Pest Friends is a glittering tribute to the black-billed magpie that lights up with holographic sparkle in direct light, and shows off its subtle side, with subtle blue-purple shifts, in indirect light. Black-billed magpies may ruffle feathers with their noisy antics, but to deer they’re heroic “pest friends”. By landing on the deer to eat their ticks, magpies help slow the spread of tick-borne illness and score a tasty snack. This polish dries textured due to the glitter, but a regular top coat will smooth it out. For extra \"plumping\" a glitter grabber or second coat of top coat is recommended. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish, @ihavethisthingwithpolish, and opposum_claw shown over Understory Priming Base Coat.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-213321.jpg?v=1780775399","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-793.jpg?v=1781916081","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-213155.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-05_7965f4fd-c8e2-4a42-b0db-5dacbf881c5a.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-07_d8da3783-ddf8-4e97-8c5e-ac09d47f641f.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9807.jpg?v=1781240987","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2481.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8546.jpg?v=1780775427","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--9_0561c7bf-da15-4fe1-a2ae-f4dbce0597ca.jpg?v=1781241150","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--3_f50afb50-ffe1-49ff-b6fb-146e7d889ec1.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--4_3731b7f0-003a-42b8-b47a-6491d191b9f5.jpg?v=1780775427","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-02_69b01f7f-97a4-434a-8adf-982567c32875.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9804-2.jpg?v=1781240981","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-08_3333041a-641b-48fa-b71b-156e07b02775.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--5_7af9a9a3-056c-481a-9a05-9d6f5ffc1c86.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--8_4c57a2e5-9540-45a3-a818-01b40d7bfca7.jpg?v=1781241150","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2517.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_eff77f12-6654-4b00-bfed-2bd2d281eb9d.jpg?v=1780775428","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/