lish-529.jpg?v=1781915597","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-06.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-1796.jpg?v=1780730444","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--5_336994ae-2db1-4315-82e1-19dc9a36c532.jpg?v=1781055736","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8455.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_65a42626-f5ec-4e35-8088-249525ac989d.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-03.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_ebad652e-21df-4a8e-a80f-933ff6b0b063.jpg?v=1781055736","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-707.jpg?v=1781915597","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-212824.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-04_14f0ed23-5b2e-48ee-bf71-ee482cdef902.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-1823.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--3_e44f8c86-cbca-4bb3-8d4e-0c23e206467b.jpg?v=1781055736","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-5_4d0a9db5-39a4-4d9f-ba84-e4ff0c9445d8.jpg?v=1781098360","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-20260531113142.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_d2964b97-d109-4625-bd3a-6a1ac32de885.jpg?v=1780730144","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-212747.jpg?v=1780730144"]],"430014":["Scavenger Hunt is a black jelly base with a strong green shimmer that shifts to red-purple in extreme angles. This polish is inspired by the giant water scavenger beetle, one of the largest aquatic beetles in North America. Although adults will scavenge decaying matter, the larvae are voracious predators, crushing and consuming their prey with pincher-like jaws.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-9.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-10.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-8.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-2.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-5.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-3.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-4.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-6.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-7.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-1.jpg?v=1785384986","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Scavenger_Hunt-11.jpg?v=1785384986"]],"430015":["Rich, warm violet base with shifts to a cooler indigo, packed with red-pink and blue-violet shimmer. Inspired by a tiny tyrant of the American Southwest, the Lucifer hummingbird, The Fast and the Furious provides bold color and high-impact shimmer that's as fierce as the bird itself. Buildable in 1–2 coats. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish and @ihavethisthingwithpolish shown in two coats over Understory Priming Base Coat.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-20260525135515-2.jpg?v=1786650451","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-04_70e07b8d-92ec-47e3-aa82-9e97b7106ef6.jpg?v=1780768435","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6254_e5c5a58d-8f61-4400-a522-a09c73352a74.jpg?v=1780768435","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-220602.jpg?v=1781060463","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--12.jpg?v=1780975180","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-06_585f06a5-9c4c-481a-823a-60ef8e195be4.jpg?v=1786645840","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8395.jpg?v=1780768435","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--18_87172761-6186-46aa-b89e-98d8180573a2.jpg?v=1781920269","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8384.jpg?v=1780768390","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-225330.jpg?v=1780768435","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--13.jpg?v=1780975180","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--20.jpg?v=1781920301","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6254.jpg?v=1780768414","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--19_4aa291e2-1d0e-4596-896a-fcf935f70c6a.jpg?v=1781920301","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-01_cb639c8b-3bb3-427d-8b42-1802df68ae40.jpg?v=1780768435","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-0016.jpg?v=1780975180","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-05_a27cf7e8-134b-4289-91e6-c7dd082ee47b.jpg?v=1780768435","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-8400.jpg?v=1780768436","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6248.jpg?v=1786650271","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--14.jpg?v=1780975180"]],"430016":["A neutral mid-tone purple with golden shimmer that adds a soft glow in lower lighting, and more pronounced, silver-leaning shimmer in bright direct light. The formula builds to full coverage in 2-3 coats for most nail lengths. The Fixer is inspired by leadplant, a hardy prairie shrub with purple blooms and stalks tipped with bronze as the plant ages. With taproots that can reach 15 feet deep, leadplant is an ecosystem powerhouse- providing food in the form of pollen, nectar, foliage, and seeds. As a bonus, it \"fixes\" soil by pulling nitrogen from the air and converting it to a fertilizer for other plants with the aid of the bacteria that live in its extensive root system.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-7988.jpg?v=1786647975","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_7920.jpg?v=1786335031","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8004.jpg?v=1786500668","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Kayla.jpg?v=1786332673","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Maya_c9d70368-04fa-4b2e-84da-d2a012870ceb.jpg?v=1786333476","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_20260803_131838__1000_x_1000_pixel.jpg?v=1786330878","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Fixer_thumb_bottle_1_1.jpg?v=1786332446","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Lana-Fixer_Collage.jpg?v=1786336258","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/DSC_0410.jpg?v=1786500557","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Christine-The_Fixer_Collageg.jpg?v=1786334992","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Brandi.jpg?v=1786334242","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Leana_Collage_Fixer.jpg?v=1786334095","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Ronita-Collage_042b1510-6549-4047-b301-c22822897a28.jpg?v=1786330905","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-221012.jpg?v=1786647785","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/IMG_8922.jpg?v=1786334124","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Natalie-Fixer_Collage.jpg?v=1786333476","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Cassandra_collage-Fixer.jpg?v=1786500541","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/DSC_0337.jpg?v=1786500557"]],"430017":["Tinted ridge-filling base coat with a soft blurring effect. This PVB-free priming base coat smooths the nail surface, improves polish wear, and provides a subtle tint that lightly blurs stains and other imperfections. Ideal under sheer or buildable polishes, it reduces visible nail line while allowing color to build evenly. It can also be worn alone in 2 coats to enhance the look of your natural nails. Like its namesake, it supports and enhances everything layered above it.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-7738.jpg?v=1781301927","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-7741.jpg?v=1781056019","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-7746.jpg?v=1781056020","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-7759.jpg?v=1781056059"]],"430018":["A bright bubblegum-pink base with a cool blue-cyan aurora shimmer. Wild at Heart is inspired by the resilient wild prairie rose, a flower whose delicate beauty belies its strength. Unlike its ornamental cousins, the prairie rose thrives where others wilt, capable of surviving even fire and drought. This polish is a tribute to all of nature's unstoppable spirits. Buildable in 1–2 coats. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish and @ihavethisthingwithpolish shown in two coats over Understory Priming Base Coat.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_d0a0aeee-375b-4e2b-9191-2867cf8036b7.jpg?v=1781059932","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_30a2a5cd-a42e-442f-987d-d80c1940d646.jpg?v=1780773310","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2598_b73889c6-feb5-46e6-b519-9c36cc226dc5.jpg?v=1786502361","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--5_cf3936a1-7867-46cf-9b5d-37e2ec2fdc48.jpg?v=1786645999","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-2630_f4575fb2-2487-4