ght. Inspired by the versatile and vibrant vervain plant, celebrated by gardeners for its spectrum of hues from blue to purple to pink, this shade is a tribute to unapologetic confidence. Buildable in 2–3 coats. *Swatches by @olive_nail_polish and @ihavethisthingwithpolish shown in two coats over Understory Priming Base Coat.",["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_325948e6-fdee-4f47-ad48-98e0525c7a45.jpg?v=1781919055","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-1343_80d478af-e03b-47d6-8235-03c8844a7089.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--7_fdac2593-02de-4ca5-bb9b-e6fe0db988ad.jpg?v=1781919065","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--6_87e2414d-5727-4ecc-ade5-5929881acfe7.jpg?v=1781242139","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6602.jpg?v=1780778259","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-221441_57ab3d46-5c57-4af0-b8da-fa3efb869569.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-9897-4.jpg?v=1781242353","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish_c84891d7-9523-453c-a676-e3a993916d50.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--2_a4ba500b-cf8a-4073-8d17-6d15b5dc1fd1.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--6_de76bae9-8d33-48c1-89e6-965858d205f9.jpg?v=1781919065","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-03_914d8475-4206-4eaa-b301-603b50f22ccb.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6615.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish--4_d0dddc1e-8861-4924-8a4a-1e4d307c2534.jpg?v=1781242139","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570/0888/files/Nail_polish-6603.jpg?v=1780778284","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/8570